exponentialParts is operation
exponentialParts purpose "cexp(x + iy): e^x cis(y), Annex G's cases for infinities and NaN"
exponentialParts invariant none
exponentialParts typeParameter none
exponentialParts input x Float64 copied
exponentialParts input y Float64 copied
exponentialParts output Complex
