exponentialParts at begin do findXNan1
exponentialParts at begin branch if xNan goto realNan else goto realNotNan
exponentialParts at realNan do findCheck11
exponentialParts at realNan branch if check1 goto nanZero else goto nanBoth
exponentialParts at nanZero do makeNanZeroResult
exponentialParts at nanZero return ok nanZeroResult
exponentialParts at nanBoth do findBothNan1
exponentialParts at nanBoth do makeNanBothResult
exponentialParts at nanBoth return ok nanBothResult
exponentialParts at realNotNan do findXInfinite1
exponentialParts at realNotNan do findYFinite1
exponentialParts at realNotNan branch if xInfinite goto realInfinite else goto realFinite
exponentialParts at realInfinite do findPositive1
exponentialParts at realInfinite branch if positive goto plusInfinityCase else goto minusInfinityCase
exponentialParts at plusInfinityCase branch if yFinite goto plusFinite else goto plusOther
exponentialParts at plusFinite do findCheck21
exponentialParts at plusFinite branch if check2 goto plusZero else goto plusAngle
exponentialParts at plusZero do makePlusZeroResult
exponentialParts at plusZero return ok plusZeroResult
exponentialParts at plusAngle do findPlusCosine1
exponentialParts at plusAngle do findPlusSine1
exponentialParts at plusAngle do findPlusReal1
exponentialParts at plusAngle do findPlusImag1
exponentialParts at plusAngle do makePlusAngleResult
exponentialParts at plusAngle return ok plusAngleResult
exponentialParts at plusOther do findPlusNan1
