hyperbolicTangentParts is operation
hyperbolicTangentParts purpose "ctanh(x + iy): Kahan's formula, (x finite, y infinite) gives a zero with the sign of sin 2x and a NaN as glibc does (so ctan(inf + iy) is a NaN and a zero), and for |x| >= 20 the limit +-1 + 4 i sin y cos y e^(-2|x|); Annex G's cases"
